  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Using the relation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;is speed of light in vacuum.</p><p>After analysing each option, we get option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is the correct option</p><p>as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>60</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p>",
